<!--Blurb: Answers to still more riddles.-->
<h2 class="h1">Bondage<br/>
Bandhana Sutta  (SN 1:65)</h2>
<div class="verse">
<pre>“With what 	is the world placed in bondage?
What 	is its exploration?
With the abandoning
of what
		are all bonds broken?”</pre>
<pre>“With delight 		is the world placed in bondage.
Directed thought		is its exploration.
With the abandoning
of craving
		all bonds are broken.”</pre>
</div><!--end verse-->

      </div><!--end:sutta-->
